),(0,t.jsxs)("div",{className:"space-y-4 text-text-dark leading-relaxed",children:[(0,t.jsx)("p",{children:"As a passionate gym-goer, our founder Ellie is big on fuelling her body right—but she is also a massive foodie. The problem? Most spots don't offer meals that feel both nourishing and satisfying. So, Ellie's Oats was founded as a go-to spot where nutritious meets delicious—without leaving us feeling sluggish and off-track the next day. Why should a fuelling and tasty meal be saved for only the weekend?"}),(0,t.jsx)("p",{children:"Healthy eating doesn't have to be boring. And socialising doesn't have to mean throwing your goals out the window. We're all about balance—fuel your body, enjoy your life, and never settle for boring oats."})]})]})]}),(0,t.jsxs)("div",{className:"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-12",children:[(0,t.jsxs)("div",{className:"lg:col-span-2 bg-background rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8 md:p-12 order-2 lg:order-1",children:[(0,t.jsx)("h2",{className:"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-brand-green",children:"A bit about our Founder"}),(0,t.jsxs)("div",{className:"space-y-4 text-text-dark leading-relaxed",children:[(0,t.jsx)("p",{children:"After gaining a first-class Psychology Degree from the University of Liverpool, I didn't really know what I wanted to do with my life. I tried a couple of jobs including one which was always portrayed as a 'life-long career'. However, I always wanted more than what my office-job had to offer."}),(0,t.jsx)("p",{children:"It was on a solo trip to Australia (why does every life-changing story start with that!) back in 2023 where I realised that there was so much more to life than drinking every weekend & living for short-term goals. The day I landed back in the UK, I got myself an online coach and that's where the gym and nutrition started to play a key role in my life."}),(0,t.jsx)("p",{children:"In February 2025, I left my job and did a few months travelling around Australia, Thailan